# Normalize line endings.
#
# The repo was committed with LF. Editing on Windows rewrites files with CRLF,
# which makes git report every line of a touched file as changed — 57 files
# showed up as "modified" with no content change at all.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` stores LF in the repo and checks out LF, so the working
# tree matches what the Linux containers and CI actually run.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.dwg binary
*.AppImage binary

# Generated; collapse in diffs and reviews.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
